  m_Name: WednesdayIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  dialogueType: 0
  sentences:
  - Hello.
  - I'm here to drop off my Oubert.
  - She's very high maintenence and is quite popular with the male Cuberts.
  - Oubert can get pretty anxious around male Cuberts, so please don't let them get
    too close to her.
  - I will be back in the evening. See ya!
